<section><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-8 overview-content-column" align="justify"><h2><b>Cloud Foundations for Modern Business</b></h2><p>Cloud technology helps organizations scale services, improve resilience, and deliver new capabilities faster. IFOX designs and implements cloud solutions that align infrastructure, applications, data, and security with your business priorities.</p><p>Whether you are moving existing workloads, modernizing applications, or establishing a reliable delivery pipeline, we create a clear path to a secure and manageable cloud environment.</p><ul class="list-unstyled"><li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Secure and resilient infrastructure designed around your workloads.</p></li><li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Migration planning that reduces disruption and protects business data.</p></li><li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> DevOps practices that improve delivery speed, quality, and visibility.</p></li></ul></div><div class="col-lg-4 text-center ifox-service-mainoverview-image-column"><img src="~/assets/img/service-mainoverview.webp" class="img-fluid ifox-service-mainoverview-image" alt="Cloud solutions services" /></div></div></div></section>
 <section><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-8 overview-content-column" align="justify">
     <h2><b>Cloud Strategy Connected to Business Priorities</b></h2>
     <p>Moving to the cloud is not only an infrastructure decision. It affects application design, security, operations, data management, cost, and the way teams deliver change. We help connect these decisions to practical business goals such as resilience, faster releases, improved customer experiences, and more efficient operations.</p>
     <p>Our team assesses the current environment, identifies dependencies, and recommends an architecture that fits the workload. Where a phased approach is more appropriate, we create a roadmap that reduces risk while delivering useful progress at each stage.</p>
     <ul class="list-unstyled"><li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Workload discovery and readiness assessments before migration or modernization.</p></li><li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Architecture decisions based on security, performance, availability, and cost.</p></li><li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Cloud operating practices that give teams visibility and control after launch.</p></li></ul>
  </div><div class="col-lg-4 text-center align-self-center ifox-service-mainoverview-image-column"><img src="~/assets/img/service-mainoverview1.webp" class="img-fluid ifox-service-mainoverview-image" alt="Cloud solutions services" /></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="ifox-content-right"><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-4 text-center align-self-center ifox-service-mainoverview-image-column"><img src="~/assets/img/service-mainoverview2.webp" class="img-fluid ifox-service-mainoverview-image" alt="Cloud services" /></div><div class="col-lg-8 overview-content-column" align="justify">
